summary:
  The larger view gives the focus back only when it is closed by hand.

history:
  The song ends while its cover is shown larger, and the next has no
  picture: the view shuts by itself. An item nobody sees keeps the focus in
  Qt, and the next Space was spent on closing a view that was already shut.
  The focus goes back whichever way the view shuts. This mutant returns it
  only from closeLarger.

target:
  package/contents/ui/CoverTouch.qml

find:
      onLargerChanged: if (!larger) _handBack(largerView)

replace:
      onLargerChanged: if (!larger && largerOffered) _handBack(largerView)

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_space_after_a_click_on_the_cover_is_still_the_pages,
  which runs first and pins the line, and behind it by
  tests/qml/tst_covertouch.qml::test_a_view_that_shuts_by_itself_gives_the_keyboard_back,
  which presses the keys.
  Line-neutral.
